OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and some showers
OL,6,Fthrough the day, some turning heavy
OL,7,Fand thundery in the afternoon and
OL,8,Fearly evening. Best of the dry, bright
OL,9,Fweather in the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with some clear spells
OL,12,Fthrough the evening and overnight for
OL,13,FDundee and Fife. Cloudier in the north
OL,14,Fand west with a few light showers.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FMostly dry with sunny
OL,17,Fspells in the morning, but the odd
OL,18,Flight shower possible at first. The
OL,19,Fodd afternoon shower before a band of
OL,20,Fheavy rain pushes east in evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
